<title>SWEDEN: Swedish Handelsbanken forecast for Swedish economy.</title>
<headline>Swedish Handelsbanken forecast for Swedish economy.</headline>
<dateline>STOCKHOLM 1997-05-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Swedish bank Handelsbanken on Thursday forecast these figures for the Swedish economy.</p>
<p>					1997	1998	1999</p>
<p> Gross Domestic Product	  2.0	 3.0	 2.6</p>
<p> Private consumption	     1.9	 2.3	 2.7</p>
<p> Public consumption		0.5	 0.5	 0.5</p>
<p> Gross investments		 0.6	 5.6	 4.4</p>
<p> Inventory investments*	  0.2	 0.2	 0.1</p>
<p> Exports			     7.5	 7.2	 5.5</p>
<p> Imports			     7.5	 7.2	 5.9</p>
<p> CPI				   0.5	 1.7	 2.2</p>
<p> Industrial production	   6.1	 5.8	 4.5</p>
<p> Open unemployment level	 8.2	 7.6	 7.3</p>
<p> Total unemployment level     12.7	12.1	11.8</p>
<p> Trade balance, bln Skr	  127	 143	 148</p>
<p> Current account, bln Skr	 50	  68	  72</p>
<p> Current account, pct of GDP   2.9	 3.7	 3.8</p>
<p> Savings, pct of income	  5.0	 4.3	 4.3</p>
<p> Real disposable income	  1.5	 1.5	 2.6</p>
<p> State borrowing need, bln Skr  20	  10	  15</p>
<p> Budget deficit, pct of GDP    1.9	 0.1	 0.1</p>
<p> State debt, pct of GDP	  76	  73	  71</p>
<p>* Change in percent of last year's GDP.</p>
<p>-- Stockholm newsroom +46-8-700 1017</p>
</text>
